# GlobeTrotter Environment Variables Example

# Frontend Map Provider Configuration (Optional)
# GlobeTrotter includes production-grade OpenStreetMap (Nominatim / Photon) Geocoding
# and OSRM real road routing out of the box with zero setup required.
# If you wish to use Mapbox vector tiles and Mapbox Directions API, provide your public token here:
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=your_mapbox_public_token_here

# Backend API Endpoint
VITE_ODOO_API_URL=http://localhost:8069/api/v1/globetrotter
